        "id": "00000000000000000000000000000002",
        "content": [
          "The data is the Department of Homeland Security (DHS) only.\n",
          "Count separations and accessions by effective_month, never by reported_month or source_file.\n",
          "drp_indicator = 'Y' marks the 2025 deferred resignation program (DRP) wave, a one-time event; report rates with and without it.\n",
          "Where location_imputed or pay_imputed is true the value is synthetic, drawn from USAJOBS postings; label it as synthetic in the answer.\n",
          "pay_redacted NULL means pay is missing, not redacted; only pay_redacted = true is redaction.\n",
          "staffing_plan is synthetic demo data (is_synthetic); say so whenever it is used."
        ]
      }
